      "green": "collab-review-receipt-green01 18pass,0fail/skip; all seven valid variants also admitted before each corrupted variant is rejected"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-R2",
      "finding": "R38 access omitted the locked session event sequence, so real pending-submission authorization was signed correctly but actual admin completion built an absence intent and refused",
      "fix": "Copy current locked session sequence into access and use currentDelivery for explicit binding; no-binding completes through current-policy gate without reading delivery history, preserving administrative off/observe semantics and enforce428",
      "red": "p3-review-admin-pending-red01 1fail expected200 actual409 after real signed exact source grant",
      "green": "p3-review-admin-green01 28pass,0fail/skip"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-R3",
      "finding": "Actual NewRouter issuer revocation refused completion but surfaced503 instead of a current-authority refusal",
      "fix": "Only pgx.ErrNoRows maps to content-free404 delivery_completion_not_found in deliveryCompletionError; actual database failures continue to propagate, and terminal INSERT no-row already maps to conflict before this function",
      "red": "collab-auth-router03:9pass/2fail including revoked_issuer and parent; actual state remained uncompleted",
      "green": "collab-auth-router04:11pass/0fail/skip on new enf_p3_collab_auth04, frozen compile04 matches all12 current reviewed scope files"
    }
  ],
